<Base title="About AajKaMandi" description="AajKaMandi publishes official daily mandi prices and NECC egg rates in Hindi and English.">
  <h1>About AajKaMandi</h1>
  <p>AajKaMandi shows the latest official mandi prices for farmers and traders in Hindi and English. We do not buy or sell crops. Prices come straight from the government Agmarknet system and are refreshed every morning, and each mandi's price history is kept so you can see the trend.</p>
  <p>Spotted a wrong price? <a href="/contact/">Tell us</a>.</p>
</Base>
